=====Prefix conjugation=====

The prefix conjugation ''yqtl-'' takes three forms: ''yiqtal-, yaqtil-'', and ''yaqtul-''. The specific pattern is determined by the stem consonants.<ref>In general, if the second or third root consonant is a [[guttural|laryngal]] ('''''ᵓ'''aleph, '''ᶜ'''ayin, '''h, ḥ''''', '''''ḫ''''', or '''''ġ'''''), the imperfect has the ''yiqtal-'' form; else the type is ''yaqtul-'' for so-called strong, I-n, II-w, and II-gem verbs, and ''yaqtil-'' for I-wy, II-y, and III-y verbs (for those verbal classes see the section on strong and weak verbs). But there are quite a few exceptions [Sivan (2001), pp. 116-117, and ''passim'' pp. 117-177].</ref> Therefore, there is no simple one-on-one relation with the three ''qtl'' vowel patterns, ''qatal, qatil'', and ''qatul'', because the ''qtl'' vowel pattern depends not on the consonant pattern, but on a verb's meaning (active or stative).

