==== Nouns and adjectives ====
=====Paradigm=====
[[Nouns]] ([[substantive]]s, [[adjective]]s, personal names) in their basic form ([[nominative]] [[singulative number|singular]]) end in ''-u''. Nominal forms are categorized according to their [[inflection]] into: [[grammatical cases|cases]] ([[nominative]], [[genitive]], and [[accusative]]), state (absolute and construct), [[gender]] (masculine and feminine), and [[grammatical number|number]] ([[singulative number|singular]], [[dual (grammatical number)|dual]], and [[plural]]).

